```uvl
features
	EdgeSystem
		mandatory
			NetworkInterface
				or
					Mobile
						alternative
							ThreeG {Cost 30}
							FourG {Cost 40}
							FiveG {Cost 75}
					WiFi
					Ethernet {Cost 15}
			Antenna
				alternative
					Small {Cost 3}
					Normal {Cost 4}
					Large {Cost 5}
			VNF
				or
					Monitor
					Firewall
					Encryption

constraints
	Ethernet => !Antenna
```